<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- $9-11 target for Endocare.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- $9-11 target for Endocare.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst John Calcagnini said he initiated coverage of Endocare Inc with a buy rating, and set a 6-12 month price target of $9-$11.</p>
<p>-- estimated loss of $0.17 per share for 1997, loss of $0.07 for 1998, and earnings of $0.71 for 1999.</p>
<p>-- company makes and markets urological products to treat prostate cancer and benign prostatic hyperplasia.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 1/8 to 4-5/8.</p>
</text>
